          "prompt": "Read each Service configuration and verification excerpt. Decide whether it supplies a stable endpoint, selects the intended Pods, maps the port correctly, and verifies actual application traffic. Intended Deployment Pods carry app=sandbox-app and listen on container port 8080. Supplied Service port=80. Supplied client’s expected response=application check passed.",
          "buckets": [
