              "text": "Service spec.selector: {app: sandbox-app}; ports: [{port: 80, targetPort: 80}]. Intended Pods listen on 8080. No endpoint inspection or client test retained; reviewer marks application traffic verified from the Service declaration."
            },
            {
              "item_id": "e2",
              "text": "Service spec.selector: {app: sandbox-app}; ports: [{port: 80, targetPort: 8080}]. Applied Service provides a stable address for changing selected Pods. EndpointSlice evidence identifies the intended sandbox-app Pods. Client test through the Service address on port 80: application check passed."
